  "appliesTo": "Local Authorities have a duty to determine school term dates for local authority maintained schools which must be open to pupils for 190 days in an academic year, and 195 days for teachers.",
  "academyNote": "Foundation, Trust, Voluntary Aided schools and Academies are responsible for setting their own holiday dates. So individual schools, may choose to follow a pattern and/or specific dates that do not match those set by us.",
  "localFacts": [
    {"fact": "Cambridgeshire County Council determines term dates for local authority maintained schools; foundation, trust, voluntary aided schools and academies set their own holiday dates.", "source": "https://www.cambridgeshire.gov.uk/residents/children-and-families/schools-learning/school-term-dates-closures"},
    {"fact": "The published dates total 195 days, from which each school chooses five days to set aside as professional training days.", "source": "https://www.cambridgeshire.gov.uk/residents/children-and-families/schools-learning/school-term-dates-closures"},
    {"fact": "Staff training dates are set at the discretion of the school, so the council asks parents to check the school's own website.", "source": "https://www.cambridgeshire.gov.uk/residents/children-and-families/schools-learning/school-term-dates-closures"},
    {"fact": "The council gives the number of days in each half term, for example 39 days from Tuesday 1 September to Friday 23 October 2026.", "source": "https://www.cambridgeshire.gov.uk/residents/children-and-families/schools-learning/school-term-dates-closures"},
    {"fact": "In 2027-28 the Christmas holidays are listed as Monday 20 December to Friday 31 December, and the spring term starts on Tuesday 4 January 2028.", "source": "https://www.cambridgeshire.gov.uk/residents/children-and-families/schools-learning/school-term-dates-closures"},
    {"fact": "The 2027-28 Easter holidays run from Monday 3 April to Monday 17 April 2028, and the summer term starts on Tuesday 18 April.", "source": "https://www.cambridgeshire.gov.uk/residents/children-and-families/schools-learning/school-term-dates-closures"}
